                        "entry_id": "c91014c7-9fe3-3431-943b-c51431adcc6c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A type of coarse Austrian parboiled sausage, the most popular kind of sausage sold at food stalls in Vienna."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Austria",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
